{"id":"084fa6cdd966d3ef","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-modal-path-semantics.md","title":"Semantics of Finite Modal Paths","display":"lem-modal-path-semantics — Semantics of Finite Modal Paths","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-modal-path-semantics","aliases":["89-lem-modal-path-semantics"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"lem-modal-path-semantics — Semantics of Finite Modal Paths","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-iteration]]","[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-modal-path-semantics"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-modal-path-semantics</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-modal-path-semantics — Semantics of Finite Modal Paths"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e3dbb6a9ccbd6f00\" href=\"?note=e3dbb6a9ccbd6f00\" title=\"89-df-modal-iteration\">89-df-modal-iteration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9f00301866fbd6f0\" href=\"?note=9f00301866fbd6f0\" title=\"89-df-satisfaction-modal\">89-df-satisfaction-modal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W,R,V)\">\\(M=(W,R,V)\\)</span> 为 Kripke 模型，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^n\">\\(R^n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^n\">\\(\\Box^n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Diamond^n\">\\(\\Diamond^n\\)</span> 使用有限路径和句法递归。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}modal\\text{-}path\\text{-}semantics}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nM,w\\models\\Box^nA&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall v\\in W\\;(wR^nv\\to M,v\\models A),\\\\\nM,w\\models\\Diamond^nA&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists v\\in W\\;(wR^nv\\land M,v\\models A).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}modal\\text{-}path\\text{-}semantics}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nM,w\\models\\Box^nA&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall v\\in W\\;(wR^nv\\to M,v\\models A),\\\\\nM,w\\models\\Diamond^nA&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists v\\in W\\;(wR^nv\\land M,v\\models A).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 72、88–89；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>零次幂为恒等关系，所以两式均还原为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models A\">\\(M,w\\models A\\)</span>。归纳步对第一条使用盒真值条款及路径拼接；第二条使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Diamond B=\\neg\\Box\\neg B\">\\(\\Diamond B=\\neg\\Box\\neg B\\)</span> 和同一拼接。空的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 步可及集合使盒全称为真、菱形存在为假，包含死端情况。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-iteration","status":"resolved","id":"e3dbb6a9ccbd6f00","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-iteration]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-satisfaction-modal","status":"resolved","id":"9f00301866fbd6f0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M=(W,R,V)","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in W","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"R^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Diamond^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}modal\\text{-}path\\text{-}semantics}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nM,w\\models\\Box^nA&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall v\\in W\\;(wR^nv\\to M,v\\models A),\\\\\nM,w\\models\\Diamond^nA&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists v\\in W\\;(wR^nv\\land M,v\\models A).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"M,w\\models A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Diamond B=\\neg\\Box\\neg B","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false}],"bytes":1256,"backlinks":[{"id":"716a176673d9ea45","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-483","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-lem-modal-path-semantics]]"}],"outgoing":["e3dbb6a9ccbd6f00","9f00301866fbd6f0"]}